OL,3,AAre max strength cold and flu pills
OL,4,Aworth the money?
OL,5,
OL,6,FYour throat's painful, your head throbs
OL,7,Fand your blocked nose has kept you
OL,8,Fawake all night. It's that time of year
OL,9,Fagain - flu season - and you'll try
OL,10,Fanything to feel normal.
OL,12,FBut is that pricey max strength flu
OL,13,Fremedy really any better than a basic
OL,14,Fbox of painkillers?
OL,16,F"The big brands have been around for a
OL,17,Fwhile, they've been tested, and there
OL,18,Fare adverts on the TV saying they're
OL,19,Freally good," says Prof Jayne Lawrence,
OL,20,Fhead of the pharmacy division at the
OL,21,FUniversity of Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
