OL,3,AAre max strength cold and flu pills
OL,4,Aworth the money?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"But in reality, there's very little
OL,7,Fdifference. Personally, I'd always go
OL,8,Ffor the cheaper ones - and they've also
OL,9,Fbeen tested."
